  "description": "Find the minimum number of taps needed to cover the range [0, n] in a garden of length n.",
  "target": 5,
  "pseudocode": "1. maxReach = array of size n+1 initialized to 0\n2. for range in ranges: calculate start and end, update maxReach[start] = max(maxReach[start], end)\n3. taps = 0, currEnd = 0, nextEnd = 0\n4. for i from 0 to n-1:\n5.   nextEnd = max(nextEnd, maxReach[i])\n6.   if i == currEnd:\n7.     taps++, currEnd = nextEnd",
